WEBVTT

00:01:58.155 --> 00:02:00.509
You know it in your gut,

00:02:00.533 --> 00:02:02.233
in your bones.

00:02:03.117 --> 00:02:06.246
We are each part
of the planet's living systems,

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:11.505
knitted together with almost
7.7 billion human beings

00:02:11.529 --> 00:02:15.001
and 1.8 million known species.

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:18.795
We can feel the connections between us.

00:02:19.712 --> 00:02:21.796
We can feel the brokenness

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:23.992
and the closing window to heal it.

00:02:25.028 --> 00:02:27.818
This earth, our home,

00:02:28.615 --> 00:02:33.047
is telling us that a better way of being
must emerge, and fast.